{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32135","headline":"常林欢歌 · 温庭筠","name":"常林欢歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宜城酒熟花覆桥，沙晴绿鸭鸣咬咬。\n穠桑绕舍麦如尾，幽轧鸣机双燕巢。\n马声特特荆门道，蛮水扬光色如草。\n锦荐金炉梦正长，东家咿喔鸡鸣早。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32135.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32135","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}